{"ID":"20240314091849-9lhy77d","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091849-9lhy77d","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091849-9lhy77d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170043-gajvkqq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170116-z4oq7c7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:366,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170116-1j7ge94\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"【桃花汤】\u0026amp;【白头翁汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170121"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170043-gajvkqq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-gajvkqq","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下利便脓血者，桃花汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170043-gsp6ui5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-gsp6ui5","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桃花汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170043-z2zr75i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-z2zr75i","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤石脂（一半全用、一半筛研末）一升、干姜二两、粳米一升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170043-t5lv7v7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-t5lv7v7","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三昧，以水七升，煮米令熟，去滓，温服七合，内赤石脂末方寸匕，日三服，若一服愈，余勿服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170043-r3bgy8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-r3bgy8i","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，现在下面这个处方呢，我用得很多，诸位只要学会这个，你以后在诊所门口挂块牌子：专治大肠炎。西医绝对无治。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170043-uiyqpu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-uiyqpu9","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人打电话来的时候说我大便啊，请问你有没有办法治下利？”然后请问“你是什么下利呢？”“我一天二三十次，大便里面都是血，血啊，然后西医说我是 colitis 大肠炎。你可不可以治？”哦，桃花汤！"}]},{"ID":"20240422170043-3d5ip86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-3d5ip86","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个桃花汤用的时候。你说“老师，你说桃花这是犯桃花。”不是哦，这煮起来汤是红色的，像桃花的颜色一样鲜红的。这个赤石脂呢，分两边一半生一半熟。一般我们的剂量呢，四钱，等于两钱下去煮，两钱不要煮。干姜呢两钱，粳米呢两匙，你不要煮成那个干饭，所以两匙就够了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这三味药呢，用水七碗，把米煮熟，意思是七碗煮成三碗，这个时候吃之前再放生的赤石脂的粉末下去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。若一剂好了，大便下利好了，也没有流血，便脓血都没了，停了，就不要吃了。你如果吃太过了，整个大肠会干掉，因为赤石脂是涩剂，以后大便不出来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170043-kw1qzkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-kw1qzkb","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后病人跟你说“医生，我原来是下利，现在变成便秘。”因为你太过了，速度快不快？非常的快。真的是一服愈。这个西医治不好的，病人如果下利来找你，找遍西医，那吃了你的药，第一碗就好了，你说你的名声如何呢？这个人下利带脓血都可以治好，colitis 都可以治好。感冒怎么会治不好呢？胃炎怎么会治不好呢？对不对，什么病都会来找你。名声就是这样，就是这样建立起来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170043-coel9qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-coel9qh","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，我们休息一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170043-ymw9v1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170043-ymw9v1y","updated":"20240422170043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们继续把桃花汤介绍一下，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生用赤石脂的目的是什么？就是止利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为赤石脂是涩剂。煮熟了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"熟用赤石脂是补它的破洞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。大肠炎出来的时候，那大肠里面有很多破洞，我们用赤石脂下去把那个洞补起来。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就是因为它有这个功能，所以说你如果用黄土汤的时候，真的在那边找不到灶心土，你用赤石脂来取代它，那要煮过，它就可以把肠胃里的破洞补起来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170121-mzm3yg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170121-mzm3yg9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是桃花汤，那赤石脂颜色很红的，非常红，像桃花一样，所以命名叫桃花汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170115-imalqyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170115-imalqyw"}},{"ID":"20240422170116-fslq6eo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170116-fslq6eo","updated":"20240422170116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"热利下重者，白头翁汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170116-1j7ge94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170116-1j7ge94","updated":"20240422170116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170116-r6c7avp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170116-r6c7avp","updated":"20240422170116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁二两黄连三两黄柏三两秦皮三两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170116-4ugzw7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170116-4ugzw7t","updated":"20240422170116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水七升，煮取二升，去滓，温服一升。不愈，更服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170116-l940tlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170116-l940tlp","updated":"20240422170116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着下来呢，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"热痢下重"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁汤，跟前面的桃花汤，两个都是有热痢，但桃花汤是有脓血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桃花汤有干姜，感觉是寒痢，疑口误"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），就是看得到大便里面有血混到里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁汤这个热痢呢就是没有血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以有个病人来找你，“唉呀，我这个一天二三十次的下利”。你问他有没有血？没有血。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么知道是热痢？热痢味道很重，寒利都没什么味道"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你就问他，叫他告诉你哦。不要自己跑去闻啊，他会自己告诉你。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170116-t32xt83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170116-t32xt83","updated":"20240422170116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁汤专门治这个热痢，跟葛根汤有区别，葛根汤呢比较浅，一般的肠炎下痢用葛根汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。遇到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热痢很严重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的时候，他讲的“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"下重"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，下重就是叫做里急后重，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"什么叫里急后重？就是上完厕所以后你觉得还想上，肛门收口口收不起来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这就是里急后重的感觉，那这个时候你就要用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170116-2wadfen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170116-2wadfen","updated":"20240422170116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家看这个处方，我一再跟大家强调黄芩跟黄连，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"他这里不用黄芩，用黄连，意思就在小肠里面（发炎）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那如果是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在胃里面（发炎），一定要用黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，黄芩一定要用。那如果胃跟小肠都有问题的话，葛根黄芩黄连汤就出来了。那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄柏呢，是热入膀胱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以发炎的炎症到膀胱去会用到。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170116-z4oq7c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170116-z4oq7c7","updated":"20240422170116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个处方是治疗纯热痢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，纯热痢就没有寒，那也是一剂就知。一般来说白头翁两钱，黄连、黄柏、黄芩各三钱，白头翁的剂量比较轻是因为它的质很轻，所以你两钱就很多了。黄连两钱是一片两片，可是白头翁两钱是一票，因为它质很轻。所以开得剂量比较少一点。而这个处方呢就是以白头翁为主。"}]}]}